Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; OptiAssist - Network Printer RPC Error Fix (0x0000011b / 0x00000709)
; This issue occurs after Windows security updates due to RPC hardening.
; This key restores standard authenticated communication for shared network printers.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Print]
"RpcAuthnLevelPrivacyEnabled"=dword:00000000

